columns.description:
Returns an object that represents a key value value for each column value pair of each row of the employee table. Columns are shown using key of their internal name

```json json_schema
{
  "text": "Name",
  "date_select": "2024-01-01",
  "single_select": {
    "id": 3,
    "value" "Option 3"
  },
  "multi_select": [
      { 
          "id": 123,
          "value": "A"
      },
      {
          "id": 124,
          "value": "B"
      }
  ],
  "number": 3,
  "hr_manager": {
      "id": 100,
      "full_name": "Andrew Smith", 
      "email": "andrew@peopleforce.io"
  },
  "has_drivers_license": true
}
```
